update public.validation_conversations set perfil = $t$Woman, 57, Mexico City, event organizer. A relative of the founder and outside the core segment (18 to 35). In-person interview, held in Spanish; quotes translated into English$t$, citas = array[$t$With all the clothes I have, I don't know what to wear, so I end up in the same black trousers as always and only change the top.$t$, $t$A beautiful dress from Mango a month ago, I haven't worn it because of the cold or because I've barely left the house, and then I forget about it.$t$, $t$Maybe after the 40th garment it gets too tedious.$t$, $t$I'd keep my face out. With my face I'd think twice, for fear the photos get out.$t$], confirmo = $t$That it can save time and help her know what is in her closet: today she takes 20 minutes to decide and ends up in the same thing as always. She used /core on her own, without difficulty.$t$, contradijo = $t$She does not like the idea of uploading her face to the internet: she would upload a full-body photo only without her face. And photographing clothes is tiring: after about 40 garments it gets tedious.$t$ where id = 'b4dc2848-fa26-48a2-8824-0f17485b325f';

